### Course Information
- **{{color=emp|Meeting Time}}**: Monday/Wednesday 12:40-2:00 p.m.
- **{{color=emp|Meeting Place}}**: STEM 2201
- **{{color=emp|Pre-reqs}}** : CSE331 and (CSE320 or ECE331) I expect a solid understanding of C++ and a basic knowledge of algorithms and data structures (searching, sorting, linked lists, tree structures). You ***need*** programming experience.
- **{{color=emp|Web Page}}**: http://www.cse.msu.edu/~cse450/
